    "signature": "fn bitwise_unary_op_helper<F>(left: &super::Buffer, offset_in_bits: usize, len_in_bits: usize, op: F) -> super::Buffer where F: FnMut(u64) -> u64",
    "docs": "Apply a bitwise operation `op` to one input and return the result as a Buffer.\n\nThe input is treated as a bitmap, meaning that offset and length are\nspecified in number of bits.\n\nNOTE: The operation `op` is applied to chunks of 64 bits (u64) and any bits\noutside the offsets and len are set to zero out before calling `op`.",
